          "lastBuildDate": "2024-02-06T22:43:54.000Z",
          "description": "A father &amp; son podcast conceived by Hunter not long before his sixth birthday.\n\nHunter would often join daddy in his studio/office and always loved to talk into the microphone, doing silly voices, playing with sound effects, telling jokes and pretending he was on the news. \n\nOne day Daddy said \"shall we record this?\" And the result is this podcast.\n\nEach episode expect silly jokes, pretend news stories and the general nonsense you should usually expect from a six year old boy.",
          "author": "Al Galpin / Hunter Galpin",
